Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.84,0:01:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when Gomamon\NDigivolved into Ikkakumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.08,0:02:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He rescued me and, using his harpoon\Ntorpedo, destroyed the Black Gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'll climb\Nany mountains for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.46,0:02:15.02,Sign,Sign,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}The Messenger of Darkness, Devimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.84,0:02:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yami no Shisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.18,0:02:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.06,0:02:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place could really\Nuse a good bus system.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.16,0:02:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it looks like\Nwe're at the end of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.16,0:02:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, we're doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.08,0:02:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trapped on an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.02,0:02:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll never get out of\Nhere alive. I knew I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.24,0:02:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wouldn't like camp But\Nwould my folks listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.94,0:02:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I wanted to go to summer school
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.64,0:02:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another black gear
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.46,0:02:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sense danger
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.86,0:02:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come away!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.20,0:02:52.16,Sign,Sign,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}LEOMON
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.20,0:02:52.16,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Beast Man Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.20,0:02:52.16,Sign,Sign,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.20,0:02:52.16,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.20,0:02:52.16,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.20,0:02:52.16,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.20,0:02:52.16,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Juuouken
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.34,0:02:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leomon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.25,0:02:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you may be mighty But now you face me Your\Nkind-hearted leadership is unimpressive
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.14,0:02:59.10,Sign,,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}OGREMON
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.14,0:02:59.10,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ogre Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.14,0:02:59.10,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.14,0:02:59.10,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.14,0:02:59.10,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.14,0:02:59.10,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.14,0:02:59.10,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Haouken
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.22,0:02:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogremon, you are truly the\Nmost evil of the bad Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.76,0:02:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to your ruthlessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one asked you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.74,0:03:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one wants you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I strongly suggest that you\Ngo now while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.16,0:03:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The endless attack of Black Gears\Nwhich keep dropping from this mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is transforming perfectly peaceful\Ninnocent Digimon into monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.40,0:03:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I have come here to make it stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.34,0:03:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have been warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of you stop. Cease this\Nfoolishness. I command that the two
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.80,0:03:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of you work together for me, not\Nfight. You will work for me. I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never do that neither will I be\Nsilent for I am Devon ultimate
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.39,0:03:50.85,Sign,Sign,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}DEVIMON
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.39,0:03:50.85,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Fallen Angel Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.39,0:03:50.85,Sign,Sign,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.39,0:03:50.85,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.39,0:03:50.85,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.39,0:03:50.85,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.39,0:03:50.85,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Death Claw
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.90,0:03:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ruler of the demon underworld\Nyou must obey my every command
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.70,0:03:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sir you don't need that joker I can handle
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whatever you want done\Nwithout anyone's assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.12,0:03:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.18,0:03:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is the Digidestined\Nkids we'll be fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.28,0:04:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digidestined? Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.90,0:04:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're already here on Infinity Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.12,0:04:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now find them and\Ndestroy the entire group.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroy them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy you for having\Nthreatened the Digidestined!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.26,0:04:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fists of the Beast King!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.50,0:04:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freeze, Leomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.76,0:04:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not requesting your cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am demanding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare for the touch of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you will obey my every command.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.84,0:04:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I will obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.99,0:04:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.91,0:04:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Making a map of the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.20,0:04:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way we'll know exactly where\Nwe are and where we've already been.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that works in theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.18,0:04:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.09,0:04:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say map or mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No question, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.50,0:04:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the dude of doodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.04,0:04:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you follow that map, it'll\Nlead right to a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.62,0:04:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I can read it just fine, and\Nthat's all that's really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.78,0:04:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't need a map to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.02,0:04:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're totally lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.36,0:04:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured that out a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.66,0:05:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just figured out that these gloves\Nreally don't go with this dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.98,0:05:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I have a feeling\Nwe're going to wait here to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.92,0:05:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least it won't be a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leomon is our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.68,0:05:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With big teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.14,0:05:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just uses them for smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.76,0:05:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a just leader and\Nrole model for all Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.88,0:05:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! My map!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget the map!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.92,0:05:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepper breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about your map. That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.82,0:05:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least it didn't fall\Ninto the hands of the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.14,0:05:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't slow down, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.12,0:05:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just where do you think\Nyou're going, well children?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.34,0:05:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so good if you stop by he\Nlooks hungry to you weren't
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.32,0:05:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you small to eat and i'm\Nfull of junk food well he's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.86,0:06:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not against the little snack\Nmake it easy on yourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.20,0:06:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,give up now or else i don't\Nsee an exit door this proves
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the theory that well-executed\Nteamwork is efficient
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even for bad guys but Leomon\Nhas always been argumon's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.92,0:06:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worst enemy? What's happened to\Nhim? Ready, Leomon? One, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, Digivolve! Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.44,0:06:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.96,0:06:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.44,0:06:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.35,0:06:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Helmon Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.96,0:06:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.14,0:07:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neelmon Digiball 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.44,0:07:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earthroblem!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon, Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.14,0:07:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.26,0:07:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.60,0:07:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've all Digivolve! Come\Nwith me, T.K.! Let them...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.10,0:07:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have it, Koromon! Nova\NBlast! Harpoon Torpedo! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.02,0:07:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll sprint!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.02,0:07:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody all together now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.70,0:07:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have learned the secret of teamwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.60,0:07:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This group of six attacking\Ntogether is quite dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.28,0:07:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but why hasn't the Patamon digi-balled?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.64,0:07:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.60,0:07:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avalanche, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.22,0:08:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Howling Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.40,0:08:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, soccer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nova Brass!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.54,0:08:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, like a day at the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.32,0:08:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I need a facial.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.50,0:08:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.41,0:08:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, speak to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.12,0:08:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We aren't wounded, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.22,0:08:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all just a little exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two digivolutions in one day, no wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.48,0:08:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor B .O.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.02,0:08:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened to the bad guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.42,0:08:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.92,0:08:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think that avalanche\Nknocked them both off the cliff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.30,0:08:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.72,0:08:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless they can fly, they're goners.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.60,0:08:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither one of them had wings, so\NI'm sure they weren't airworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing is logical here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything is bound to happen,\Nincluding flying monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For one, you might be right, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.78,0:08:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.48,0:08:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that avalanche.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:09:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't figure out what set it off.\NStress accumulates until a crack develops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.58,0:09:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and with excess weight the terra firma\Nsuddenly isn't so firma you think so
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.44,0:09:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it looked to me like something blasted\Nit loose they are more powerful than
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.48,0:09:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i suspected but i shall strike while\Nthey are exhausted and destroy them all
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.32,0:09:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm intrigued that our digimon were
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.72,0:09:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Able to Digivolve twice in one day. Well
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.98,0:09:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was sure lucky for us that they were\Nable to do it i think the digimon are
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.88,0:09:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,growing stronger i wonder if that's a\Nnormal part of their evolution or if
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.16,0:09:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're bringing out something special in\Nthem a fascinating hypothesis if only we
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.84,0:09:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could test it i think today was too much\Nfor them palmon's looking very tired
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.16,0:09:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i've been tired before don't worry\Nadmit it palmon we need to stop and rest
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.30,0:09:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you know to be perfectly honest i think\Nthat would be a good idea for all of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.70,0:09:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Us rest where? I don't want to sleep on\Nthe ground. Look, a mansion or maybe it's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.70,0:10:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a hotel come on we may have found\Nother life forms look at the grounds i
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mean somebody had to have mulled the\Nlawn what a place i can't believe my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.36,0:10:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's just too good to be true i hope\Nthey have a hot tub just as long as it's
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.38,0:10:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not too hot wait you guys don't just go\Ncharging in there it might be dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.58,0:10:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, was this on your map? Hmm,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.40,0:10:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,somehow I don't think so Go ahead, Joe,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.38,0:10:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,open the door Maybe we should knock first\NJoe, nobody knocks on the door at a hotel
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.86,0:10:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place should be on your map Agumon,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you recall, you burned up my\Nmap. Oh, yeah. Well, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.56,0:10:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see a desk clerk Anybody here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.68,0:10:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks weird Feels weird Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it doesn't look or feel weird\Nto me Perhaps my definition
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.64,0:10:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of weird is different than yours\NI'm with you Think about it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.40,0:10:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we safer in the open woods\Nwith no shelter Or here in a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sturdy building we could defend\Nfrom attack I have to admit,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.18,0:10:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a point. That's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.32,0:10:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.12,0:11:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's an angel!\NWhat's an angel, T.K.?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.58,0:11:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something special that watches over\Nyou Kind of like you guys If this is a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.90,0:11:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spooked out haunted house Would there be\Npictures of angels hanging on the walls?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.42,0:11:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so relax we\Njust want to be careful and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.56,0:11:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,talk quieter or you'll wake\Neverybody up they're out
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.26,0:11:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like a light i hope they\Nhave a dress shop i've never
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,worn the same thing two days\Nin a row before let's take a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nap later well no crowds\Nwe must have missed the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,summer rush we keep missing\Neverything this is one kooky
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mixed up world let's go huh\Ndo you smell that i don't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.64,0:11:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,smell anything what is it It's\Nthe delicious odor of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.96,0:11:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Food? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.44,0:11:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very sure, and plenty of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.38,0:11:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show us where, Gabumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.80,0:11:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's this way. Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.52,0:11:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for us. Oh, boy. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.70,0:11:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.80,0:11:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.30,0:12:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that spread! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.94,0:12:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for saying this, everybody,\Nbut this looks like a setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.84,0:12:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.75,0:12:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could be some sort of trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.76,0:12:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akuma, are you guys sure\Nthat food is safe to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.94,0:12:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's eating, but their\Ntable manners are appalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.36,0:12:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess that's because they like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't bear to look any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.98,0:12:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.28,0:12:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least I won't die hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On your mark, get set.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.54,0:12:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lobster, Meteor d', is\Nthere a table with a view?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.84,0:12:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, peanut butter and pickles,\Nthis is the best pizza ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.74,0:13:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, if one of us gets\Nsick, we all get sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's teamwork, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.53,0:13:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Potato chips, chocolate chips, fish\Nand chips are any kind of chips,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.38,0:13:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and those two are colors really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.44,0:13:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we have for dessert?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heads up, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.85,0:13:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch the hair, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.44,0:13:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought some bird made\Na nest on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.18,0:13:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Warm water is perfect for\Nremoving soil and epidermis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.26,0:13:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, dirt and dead skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.44,0:13:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever my skin gets\Ndirty, I just shed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.14,0:13:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be difficult for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.54,0:13:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, may I join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.32,0:13:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey don't be shy there\Naren't any girls here
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come on in so far we\Nhaven't found any sharks in
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.14,0:13:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the water no big ones\Nit looks cold humans can
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.70,0:13:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be so silly humans aren't\Nthe only silly ones
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.90,0:13:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where's Gabumon he's not\Nsilly just shy i'll get
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.00,0:13:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in but i won't guarantee\Nthey'll like it why do
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.10,0:13:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they have to be so noisy\Nrelax forget about him
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i've never been so relaxed\Nin my whole life Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.06,0:13:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jungleman, you're not\Nsupposed to be over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.68,0:13:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back to the boy's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.20,0:14:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.14,0:14:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where'd you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.06,0:14:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.04,0:14:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only thing better is bunk beds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.26,0:14:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, this feels great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last time I had a bed\Nthis soft, I was dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How I miss sleeping on soft, silky sheets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.42,0:14:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what I don't miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.10,0:14:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't miss hiking through\Nthe blazing hot desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.42,0:14:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And another thing I really don't\Nmiss is starving in the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.06,0:14:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, we are a long way from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.64,0:14:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.60,0:14:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's okay, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all miss being home,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.22,0:14:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm sure that we're all wondering\Nif we'll ever get back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.26,0:14:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet our disappearance caused a\Nbig fuss at school and all over town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.04,0:14:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we've been gone so long, everybody\Nmust have given up looking for us by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.88,0:14:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom and Dad wouldn't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.40,0:14:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm homesick, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.48,0:14:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll find our way back Don't worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.66,0:15:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, let's just go to sleep\Nand try to have nice dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.12,0:15:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was so easy to deceive\Nthem. Even the Digi
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.26,0:15:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-Testined appear to have\Nchildish and simple minds
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.58,0:15:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready! What a joy to be rid of the\NDigidestined that lasts, and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.26,0:15:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leomon i cannot disobey your orders
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.08,0:15:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i can go to the bathroom by myself
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.48,0:15:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mind keeping you company.\NTime, it's dark and scary here for
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your information i happen to like the\Ndark stop treating me like a kid i
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,should have known it was you who\Nwere afraid to go to the bathroom by
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.64,0:15:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yourself oh Tai don't be upset with\Nme i'm not afraid i didn't really have
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.54,0:16:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to go to the bathroom i just came\Nalong because i have to protect you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.78,0:16:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then what are you doing in there i\Ndon't even want to talk about it Tai
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.98,0:16:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i don't know if that\Nugly green guy scared you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.20,0:16:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he really scared me\Nand who knows where he is
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.30,0:16:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.21,0:16:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I am going to destroy you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.32,0:16:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.06,0:16:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogremon is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.54,0:16:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.94,0:16:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.37,0:16:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The children.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.29,0:16:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you hate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hates you because I\Ncommended him to hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.92,0:16:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.26,0:16:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the real trouble starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.68,0:16:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogremon, who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.30,0:16:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Devimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks... He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the guy who\Ninvented the nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.98,0:16:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no further use for\Nthis imaginary building.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.22,0:17:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.51,0:17:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.50,0:17:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because together you are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.40,0:17:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will use my touch of evil to\Nscatter you throughout the Digi-World.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.06,0:17:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope this is a bad dream. Tai! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.36,0:17:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too weak to walk, even after\Nall that food I've eaten. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The food, the bath, the\Nbuilding, none of it was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.60,0:17:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I created all of it in\Nyour imagination. Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.68,0:17:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you, if you don't bring back my friends,\Nyou're going to be in really big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.52,0:17:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.24,0:17:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My concerns are much more\Nimportant than your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.36,0:17:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my only concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.56,0:17:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bring them back now. Bring them back?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.42,0:17:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You impudent brat, you dare to order me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to show you who's\Nreally in control here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.00,0:17:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I have discovered the secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.32,0:17:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Black Gears from below.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.24,0:17:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call them forth to do my bidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and your friends happened\Nupon this tiny island,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.98,0:18:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which is just one of the\Nfragments of the old world,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.56,0:18:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,scattered across an enormous ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.56,0:18:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pretend you are strangers\Nwho know nothing of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.76,0:18:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I am aware that you\Nare the Digidestined who
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.86,0:18:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were sent to rescue this\Nworld from my domination.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.08,0:18:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got us all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were just some kids at summer camp\Nwho somehow got sucked into your world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.34,0:18:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your little act no longer amuses me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.96,0:18:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to bring an\Nend to the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.04,0:18:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will destroy them. What? Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.26,0:18:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.17,0:18:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then the others one by one\Nonce those irritating children
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.48,0:18:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are out of the way Nothing\Nwill be able to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.28,0:18:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now do it Leomon as you command
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.08,0:18:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for Leomon do it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The black gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.88,0:19:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light drove it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.32,0:19:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devimon no longer has control over Leomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.90,0:19:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.22,0:19:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you feel, Leomon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.78,0:19:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am free of Devamon's powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.48,0:19:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leomon, do you know what this thing is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.90,0:19:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell you that for me it is proof\Nthat you are one of the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The digivices are powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the hands of anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.74,0:19:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.62,0:19:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are no match for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not harm them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.62,0:19:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leomon is helping us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.26,0:19:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.98,0:19:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't over, Leomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.58,0:19:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why have you forgotten your old friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.68,0:19:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogremon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.66,0:19:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, Leomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.86,0:19:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your soft card is your weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.88,0:19:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will never join as allies, and\Nyou will never know true power!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:20:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may defeat me, but the Digidescent\Nwill be out of your reach! No! Yes! Go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.46,0:20:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're our last hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.30,0:20:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without you, my world doesn't\Nstand a chance of survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.90,0:20:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My life is insignificant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.94,0:20:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can escape, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must prevent Devimon from pursuing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.44,0:20:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.84,0:20:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel the touch of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.22,0:20:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.94,0:20:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digidestined survived our first\Nencounter, but it won't be the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.50,0:20:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can promise them that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.50,0:20:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must not interfere with my plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.22,0:20:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.86,0:20:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you do this for me, Leomon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.28,0:20:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your every order, I shall obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.96,0:21:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I put a dream on the wind and a\Nflight, when I put a light on the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.56,0:21:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see the tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.20,0:21:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.90,0:21:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish. How are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.94,0:22:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I see my eyes, I\Nthink it will be warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That day, that time, I will be a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.90,0:22:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I see the wind, I see the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.78,0:22:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.30,0:22:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wish you. And the\Nbrother of Ampia. Take the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.38,0:22:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,image of Ampia And the brother of Ampia
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.29,0:22:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the brother of Ampia I wish\Nyou and your brother of Ampia
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.52,0:22:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the next episode\Nof Digimon Adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.66,0:23:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the next episode\Nof Digimon Adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.48,0:23:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the adventure evolves.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.04,0:24:00.00,Sign,Sign,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fs30\b1}Clash! The Freezing Digimon

